<title>USA: CCC buys 1,780 T U.S. rice for Burkina Faso.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 1,780 T U.S. rice for Burkina Faso.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it bought 1,780 tonnes U.S. milled rice in 50 kg bags for donation to Burkina Faso.</p>
<p>The CCC, which is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture, said the rice was bought at $337.97 a tonne from Supreme Rice Mill, Lake Charles, La.</p>
<p>The delivery period was set for August 20-September 5.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
